README.md:347:### Deployment - Terraform
README.md-348-
README.md-349-1. Clone the AHA package that from this repository. If you're not familiar with the process, [here](https://git-scm.com/docs/git-clone) is some documentation. The URL to clone is in the upper right-hand corner labeled `Clone uri`
README.md-350-```
README.md:351:$ git clone https://github.com/aws-samples/aws-health-aware.git
README.md:352:$ cd aws-health-aware/terraform/Terraform_DEPLOY_AHA
README.md-353-```
README.md:354:5. Update parameters file **terraform.tfvars** as below
README.md-355- - *aha_primary_region* - change to region where you want to deploy AHA solution
README.md-356- - *aha_secondary_region* - Required if needed to deploy in AHA solution in multiple regions, change to another region (Secondary) where you want to deploy AHA solution, Otherwise leave to default empty value.
README.md:357: - *AWSOrganizationsEnabled* - change the value to `Yes`. If you do NOT have AWS Organizations enabled you should be following the steps for [AHA for users who are NOT using AWS Organizations](#aha-without-aws-organizations-using-terraform)
README.md:358: - *AWSHealthEventType* - select whether you want to receive *all* event types or *only* issues.
README.md-359- - *Communications Channels* section - enter the URLs, Emails and/or ARN of the endpoints you configured previously.
README.md-360- - *Email Setup* section - enter the From and To Email addresses as well as the Email subject. If you aren't configuring email, just leave it as is.
--
README.md-365- - *ExcludeAccountIDs* - type ***just*** the name of the .csv file you want to upload if needed to exclude accounts from monitoring, else leave it to empty.
README.md-366- - *ManagementAccountRoleArn* - In ARN of the AWS Organizations Management Account assume role leave it set to default None, unless you are using a member account instead of the management account. Instructions for this configuration are in the next section.
README.md:367:3. Deploy the solution using terraform commands below.
README.md-368-```
README.md:369:$ terraform init
README.md:370:$ terraform plan
README.md:371:$ terraform apply
README.md-372-```
